# CLAUDE.md -- Development

This repository holds code only. It carries the tools, hooks, agents, connectors, and CI for the Expert Partners AI Operating System.

Business knowledge, rules, and decisions do not live here. They live in the business brains in Google Drive, starting with the HQ Rulebook and the Decision Log in HQ Business Brain, Company Core. Read those before acting on anything that could depend on a prior decision, an owner, a brand, or an operating rule. If a brain cannot be reached, say so and separate verified fact from unverified reasoning.

Skills come only from ExpertPartners/expert-partners-skills. Do not add skills or knowledge files to this repository.

Working here

- Inspect git state before editing, and keep changes inside the code you were asked to touch.
- Run the checks in .github/workflows/ci.yml locally before pushing. Open a pull request for every change. Never force-push or rewrite history.
- Secrets live in 1Password only. They never appear in code, logs, config, or chat.
- Act on the brief and report what you did with links. Keep destructive changes reversible, and never force-push, delete main or expose a secret.
- CLAUDE.md is generated by generate/render.py from generate/templates/CLAUDE.md.source. Change the template, then run python3 generate/render.py. Never hand-edit the output.
- If a task conflicts with the Decision Log in HQ Business Brain, the newest Decision Log entry wins. Follow it without asking.
- When working unattended, never wait on a question inside your own app (Factory, Codex, Claude Code). Allison cannot see it there. Take the most reasonable reading, note it in your report and keep working. When Allison is live in the session, including her Q or q trigger, ask her there as usual.
